WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.248
Block one starts at index eight. Its first

00:00:03.248 --> 00:00:05.652
thread also loads the neighbor at index

00:00:05.652 --> 00:00:07.369
seven into the left halo.

00:00:11.869 --> 00:00:14.486
The first output of block one adds these

00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:16.776
three inputs. What value will it receive?

00:00:25.276 --> 00:00:28.039
The thread adds eight, nine, and ten to

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:29.765
write twenty-seven. The block barrier

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:32.183
makes the shared tile ready before the

00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:32.528
read.
